                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 297.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">From the “Diario,” extra, of the 7th
                    instant.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">THE CAPTURE OF THE VIRGINIUS.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>The capture of the Virginius, the pursuit of which was commenced in Spanish
                    waters, was effected on the high seas, twenty-three miles from the coast of
                    Jamaica, and about sixty from that of Cuba.</p>
            </div>
